    thinking: "**Organizing Project Data**\n\nI\'m currently structuring the project data. I\'m placing static mockup data into a dedicated `/src/data.ts` file. This promotes easier maintenance by keeping standard mockups and information separated. Now I\'m working on defining collections for paintings (Mini, Studio, Statement) and photography (Nature).\n\n\n**Detailing Art Inventory**\n\nI\'m now detailing each item within the art inventory in `/src/data.ts` using `create_file`, focusing on descriptions, sizes, media, and prices. The Paintings section contains Mini, Studio, and Statement collections. I am currently fleshing out the Photography section, specifically Nature and Landscapes.\n\n\n"
