  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing Core Components**\n\nI\'ve successfully developed the essential components: `/src/types.ts` defines standard types, `/src/data.ts` houses structured seed data for both paintings and photography, and `/src/components/ArtworkCanvas.tsx` handles rendering dynamic vector-art paintings or high-resolution photography.\n\n\n**Adding Interactive Components**\n\nI\'m now focusing on interactive side components to enhance user engagement. I\'m building a `/src/components/ShoppingBasketDrawer.tsx` with modern aesthetics and checkout features, and a `/src/components/UserStoriesModal.tsx` carousel, inspired by Instagram Stories, to present artist profiles and studio insights, activated via a footer icon.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will create the `/src/components/ShoppingBasketDrawer.tsx` shopping basket drawer component. This overlay reveals a list of physical canvases current visitors have added to checkout, details about their chosen frame moldings, item price breakdowns (including packaging and courier quotes), and a checkout simulator."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 663564395
