    modified_response: "I have built a **full-stack, desktop-and-mobile-optimized fine-art portfolio application** built in modern React with a dedicated server-side Gemini AI curator. \n\nHere is a summary of the accomplishments and visual details:\n\n### \360\237\216\250 Visual & Architecture Concept\n\n*   **Warm Gallery Canvas Theme**: Styled entirely with a warm, eye-safe cream background tone (`#FAF9F6`) utilizing atmospheric paper shadows that capture the essence of high-end art lounges.\n*   **Artisanal Sketched Borders**: Built custom React vector renderers (`HandDrawnBorder`) that trace a beautiful double-pass sketching brush outline on all square buttons in signature purple (`#6A0DAD`), surrounding high-contrast pristine white interactive button cores.\n*   **Physical Device Emulator**: Engineered a fluid responsive viewport structure that acts as a gorgeous, sleek physical phone emulator module on wide desktop screen ratios (incorporating shadows and beveled edges), but automatically dissolves its bezels to fill the screen on native mobile viewports.\n\n---\n\n###  Core Functional Modules\n\n1.  **3D Shadowbox Simulated Mock-up Rig** (`ThreeDFrameMockup`):\n    *   Displays active compositions in real physical box frame mock-ups, supporting four materials: **Charcoal Black**, **Matte Linen White**, **Toasted Gilded Oak** (with natural grains), and **Raw Gallery Wrap Canvas** (featuring 3D canvas wrap-around edges).\n    *   Allows viewers to **click-and-drag or swipe directly over the canvas** to tilt, spin, and rotate the framed frame in orbital 3D perspective space, casting dynamic multi-layered drop shadows.\n    *   Includes quick preset orientation buttons: **Frontal View**, **3D Gallery Tilt**, and a **Reset Rig** orientation handle.\n2.  **Server-Side AI \"Surprise Me!\" Curation** (`/api/curate-artwork`):\n    *   Integrates the **@google/genai SDK** server-side using the `gemini-3.5-flash` model which triggers a dynamic, random abstract artwork curation based on imaginative themes and colors.\n    *   Returns complete structure metadata\342\200\224including a personalized title, poetic medium description, color palette, custom framing recommendation, and pricing valuation.\n    *   Includes an **AIC transition screen** displaying mock preparation logs while the AI curates your piece.\n3.  **Synchronized \"Studio Chronicles\" Stories** (`UserStoriesModal`):\n    *   Tapping the pulsing avatar circle in the footer launches a fullscreen, self-advancing documentary slide carousel (modeled after Insta-stories with progress bars) detailing mineral pigment origins, local carpentry wood frame sourcing, and silver-halide print recipes.\n4.  **Archival Gicl\303\251e Photo Database**:\n    *   Photography submenu divides into **Nature & Landscapes** and **Urban & Culture**, loading high-resolution gallery works from museum-grade fine art photographic repositories.\n5.  **Shopping Basket Drawer** (`ShoppingBasketDrawer`):\n    *   Allows users to secure multiple canvas configurations under different frames, computing item packaging crate costs, insured courier rates, and order confirmations.\n"
